              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *peḷḷi taruvāta nānna, viyyaṅkuḍu mañci snēhitulu ayyāru.* — After the wedding, dad and his co-father-in-law became good friends.]"
