              "text": "ముత్తాత — muttāta — \"a great-grandfather\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మా ముత్తాత కట్టిన ఇల్లు ఇంకా ఉంది. mā muttāta kaṭṭina illu iṅkā undi. The house my great-grandfather built is still standing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The father of a grandfather; a great-grandmother is ముత్తవ్వ."
            }
          ]
        },
